why you're here .


01:13:30.292 --> 01:13:36.708
Your version lacked the new password.
It's probably about 72 million .


01:13:36.792 --> 01:13:40.333
No, no . 80 million !


01:13:40.417 --> 01:13:44.708
Minus the 8 million ,
transferred yesterday.


01:13:51.000 --> 01:13:56.708
Everything you have is there.
We have shown complete with each other .


01:14:00.250 --> 01:14:05.875
I go now , and you let me go .
You have it all .


01:14:07.792 --> 01:14:13.083
And I trust that you 'll take care of
our common problem.


01:14:13.833 --> 01:14:16.375
What does he mean?


01:14:18.958 --> 01:14:25.750
I like your thinking.
Bangkok is a good place for business .


01:14:27.333 --> 01:14:31.000
I'm starting to like the city.


01:14:33.000 --> 01:14:39.208
Let's say it's true
and you would only remove Viros threat.


01:14:40.625 --> 01:14:44.917
Why floated it with corpses,
when my folks showed up on the spot.


01:14:45.000 --> 01:14:47.583
And a phone with empty accounts.


01:14:47.667 --> 01:14:52.542
Chief, what do you do?
Why do you let him go ?


01:14:53.417 --> 01:14:55.250
Why ?


01:14:55.333 --> 01:15:02.375
He is the only one who came and told
who really stole from me .


01:15:03.417 --> 01:15:06.958
He is the only one who knows
what it means to be a man.


01:15:07.042 --> 01:15:09.292
The alien lie!


01:15:10.042 --> 01:15:12.458
I've never stolen anything .


01:15:13.667 --> 01:15:17.500
You're like a father to me .


01:15:30.750 --> 01:15:32.583
And my daughter?


01:15:37.625 --> 01:15:40.000
Do you deny that too?


01:15:40.958 --> 01:15:45.208
You should know that I have had people
to monitor you.


01:15:45.292 --> 01:15:49.458
I know everything !
I know the color of your bullshit.


01:15:49.542 --> 01:15:51.875
I would not be disrespektfuld .


01:16:01.750 --> 01:16:03.667
I know ...


01:16:04.458 --> 01:16:10.083
... you'll be the Godfather .
Directing the empire , I have created .


01:16:11.125 --> 01:16:16.167
It happens maybe in your dreams,
but not today .


01:16:35.958 --> 01:16:38.917
Son of a gun , you 're still alive .


01:16:39.875 --> 01:16:42.750
You are here yet .


01:16:47.167 --> 01:16:49.250
I have a question .


01:16:49.750 --> 01:16:54.958
If you could live anywhere
in the world, what would you choose?


01:16:57.208 --> 01:16:59.583
Bangkok , of course.


01:17:16.167 --> 01:17:17.792
What do you want?


01:17:19.250 --> 01:17:21.000
Nothing.


01:17:33.625 --> 01:17:39.792
- Where's the money?
- I do not know.


01:17:44.958 --> 01:17:48.875
I gave him the phone ,
and he let me go .


01:17:49.542 --> 01:17:53.542
If you can prove otherwise ,
then do it.


01:17:55.083 --> 01:17:59.667
But we both know
you do not have anything on me .


01:17:59.750 --> 01:18:03.750
If I were you , I'd talk
with the Thai police .


01:18:05.208 --> 01:18:08.500
Like you said, they may be involved
in it .


01:18:08.583 --> 01:18:15.167
Maybe they came before you, shot Viro and Lek ,
emptied the accounts and gave you the phone.


01:18:15.250 --> 01:18:19.417
I only know that I have told you
it all.


01:18:19.750 --> 01:18:26.208
And without evidence that I killed
anyone, or stolen any money -


01:18:26.292 --> 01:18:30.458
- You can not detain me .


01:18:36.750 --> 01:18:39.667
Get the kid out of here.


01:18:46.500 --> 01:18:51.458
It's a hell of a way of life ,
always having to be on guard.


01:19:16.417 --> 01:19:22.583
Corner office , salary 2.4 million .
80 million in capital. Are you in ?


01:19:24.333 --> 01:19:25.875
Certainly .


01:19:28.917 --> 01:19:30.542
Cheers .


01:19:31.000 --> 01:19:34.111

